WEBVTT

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:40.580
This is... Sand, right?

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:43.450
Looks like the criminal is the Sandman.

00:01:43.450 --> 00:01:46.210
Please stop kidding around, Sayama-san!

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.710
I was being serious.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:55.420
Do you remember the whirlwind demon murder?

00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:58.380
That's an unsolved case from quite a while ago.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:02.220
There were a bunch of other mysterious ones, too,

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:06.100
but all of them got taken up by nonsensical departments,

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.230
and the truth of the matter still lies in darkness.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:12.730
Episode 4: One Hated By All

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:18.990
Kid, you're still getting into trouble.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:21.370
I'm not a kid.

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:26.370
Hey, kid, no matter what your reason is,

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.750
you can't go putting people in the hospital.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.630
I've heard that from you about 10,000 times.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.090
Hey, Nii-chan!

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.250
Thanks for saving me.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.180
10,000 yen as a reward.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.430
You...

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:53.690
Even if it's to help others, you can't just keep getting into fights.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:57.190
I don't know if I'd call it helping others as much as just making a living.

00:02:57.690 --> 00:03:00.820
You've got too much time on your hands.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:05.280
If we weren't able to find witnesses to speak up for you up to now,

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.410
you could've been charged with assault and placed in jail as punishment.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.710
If it comes down to that, I'll deal with it then.

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:14.210
Kid, stop making me worry about you.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.630
Say, Ossan...

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.880
Why do you care so much about what happens to me?

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.390
I guess we have a connection!

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:25.640
You're quite the vagrant.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:28.180
It makes me want to take care of you.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.940
Well, I'm sure I'm just an annoyance to you.

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.230
No.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:34.190
I'm happy!

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:40.110
"You've gotta hold your head up high when times are tough."

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:43.360
Those words are resonating within me even now.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:50.250
You've gotta hold your head up high when times are tough.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:53.370
You won't find any hope rolling around on the ground!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.470
Feels good, right?

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:07.390
Melting away.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.270
Felt so good he couldn't talk.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.840
Let me have her!

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:24.740
I'll do it!

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.410
Hey, Shu!

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.120
Just let him do what he wants.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.000
He's got a lot saved up.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.390
It's time to change the guard.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.230
A trespasser?

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.890
Just leave her alone.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.770
Letting him have his freedom under normal circumstances...

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.650
...is a condition for his cooperation.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:03.030
How long is it going to continue like this?

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.410
Do you agree to become Zet?

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.910
Yeah, I'll become Zet!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:12.910
Two years have already passed since then.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:27.010
Chew on this.

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.140
It will stimulate your Zet elements.

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:32.310
Do it after you put this on.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.180
It's made from special materials.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.270
If you wear this when you become Zet,

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:41.070
it'll fuse with your body, so you don't have to worry about it ripping.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:44.070
So I have to wear this forever?

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.160
There's no change in Jin.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.250
Our job is just to watch him.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.960
If we see a change, report it.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:03.710
Don't think about anything that's unnecessary.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:05.710
Mrs. Amagi?!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:06.260
What?

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:11.220
She's still doing that?

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:12.810
She should've been forbidden from...

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:15.560
...doing any volunteer work by the president and the chairman.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:17.390
Hey, hey...

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.650
Her daughter's there, too.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:24.860
Everyone, we have plenty of food.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.150
There are seconds to go around, so eat up!

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.200
You've really gotten used to this!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.790
You seem way more lively than when you're at home, too!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:38.290
It's because I enjoy doing this work.

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:48.800
The range of this fire extinguishing spray is further than the one from before.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.390
It's definitely gonna sell well!

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.560
It's thanks to you, Kouga-san, that the items we made for you back then...

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.100
...have been so successful as products!

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.600
This is the silver lining in the clouds!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:05.190
Kouga-san, we'll do what we can to help you from now on, too.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:08.400
When you do that again, give us a call!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:09.990
That?

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.070
Being an ally of justice!

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:14.740
We're waiting for it!

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:18.000
Thanks...

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:22.630
Hayami-san.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.460
I was waiting for you.

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:30.880
There haven't been any reports of the arsonist in the past two years.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:36.890
The world thinks that what you did acted as a deterrent.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.640
Well, the one who actually saved that family was-

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.650
It's fine! I know...

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:47.650
...how much you suffered these two years.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:54.490
My little sister told me that I'm just looking for praise.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:58.040
You started having second thoughts about justice over just one thing said to you?

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.790
Please remember the night of that party.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.040
My dream is to become an ally of justice!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.670
I like you when you're talking about your dreams like that.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.930
What do you want me to do?

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:18.140
Amagi has both the technical skills and funds to make you a hero.

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:25.810
I secretly ordered those three guys to develop a strength suit using Amagi's military technology.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.190
For your sake.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.210
Hey, Nii-chan!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.130
Over here!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.710
You can get some food!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.510
Jin-kun!

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:58.600
Huh? Nee-chan, you know that guy?

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.560
Yeah, sort of...

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.480
Um, do you see him here a lot?

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.230
We do, right?

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:10.900
Yeah, he's always by himself, and he never talks to us.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.820
But he's a pretty nice guy.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:15.820
Yeah, he's a good guy.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.240
What do you mean?

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:19.990
Ever since he came,

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:23.200
those violent punks have stopped showing up.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:27.500
That's right, I saw him totally beat 'em up.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:30.420
He secretly leaves food for us, too.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.050
He's a good guy, right?

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.090
Yeah.

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.510
It's fine.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.140
See you later.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:44.020
I'll take care of things here.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:45.930
Thanks!

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:48.440
Jin-kun!

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:52.480
Konoha?

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.740
It's been a long time.

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:58.240
You kept helping people?

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:00.620
Yes.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:01.660
Do your best.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.500
Wait! I met Akemi-san!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.000
I mean, still meet her sometimes!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:11.000
You met Oba-san?

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:15.260
I heard that you'd found your parents.

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:19.800
Akemi-san said that's what was written in a letter she received.

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:23.850
And then earlier, those guys said tha-

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:24.810
Konoha.
And then earlier, those guys said tha-

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.560
Don't come here anymore.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:36.820
You can't get close to humans.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:39.950
As long as you're Zet,

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:45.240
there's a good possibility Players will cause harm to anyone close to you.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:14.270
Ouch!

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.780
This is your place?

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:23.780
Get out!

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:24.490
No.

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:25.280
What?

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.790
No way!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:30.290
This guy was all bubbly, like woah!

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:35.250
I saw it, and these weird guys chased after me, so...

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:48.270
I met Jin-kun again in Undertown.

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:52.520
Even so, I forgot to give him this.

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.110
Did he say anything?

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:59.610
He said not to come anymore... It's weird!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.320
Apparently he's always in Undertown.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.280
If he said not to come, don't meet him.

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.620
You don't want to see him?

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.950
I can't meet him now.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.290
I have to get stronger first.

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.180
It's delicious!

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:27.220
You're really good at cooking, seriously!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.970
Get out once you're done eating.

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:35.190
Hey, is all of this yours?

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:36.690
What do you mean by that?

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:41.940
Like, your furniture and your plates, all of your stuff looks super expensive...

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.410
What kind of person are you?

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:46.320
What's your job?

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.450
What's your name?

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.080
You're ignoring me?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.330
You ignored me when I told you to get out.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:01.710
Like I can just go out after seeing
someone melt before my very eyes...

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:09.640
What?

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.890
Stay here after all.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.520
Make sure you don't go out.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:15.140
Huh? Wait!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.400
Don't leave me alone!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.640
No way.

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:20.650
Where is he?

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:24.650
What happened?

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:26.560
Switch the cameras.

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:27.910
Follow Jin!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.300
It's mine...

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.010
Hey.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.060
See? She was caught with this.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.820
You're so cunning!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.820
Shu, gonna do it?

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:07.650
Yeah!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:08.660
Let me go!

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.490
You bastards, let me go!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:12.200
Hey, Nee-chan.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:15.330
Aren't you wondering why this happened to you?

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.040
Oh, she's a fighter.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.170
Your life's useless now, anyway.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.420
So at least have some fun in the end.

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.050
Hey, Nee-chan.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:34.100
Do anything stupid and I'll melt you.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:45.650
Could it be that Jin ran out there
because he felt these guys' presence?

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:48.240
Let's try that thing!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.540
I thought something stank.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.710
Who're you?

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:04.590
Let go of her.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:09.970
I don't like how you are acting like some kind of hero.

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.220
Makes me sick to my stomach.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.890
Hey, you!

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.720
I'll save you for a 10,000 yen reward.

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:21.850
I'll pay! So please hurry up and save m-

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.480
Shut up!

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:27.610
You take money to save people?

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:31.240
You're pretty nasty for a supposed Ally of Justice.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.130
Amazing...

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:55.140
You... Are you all Players?

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:57.310
It's starting!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:58.770
Hey! What about that girl?

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.020
I'll knock her out.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.520
10,000 yen please.

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:06.650
Behind you!

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:34.800
Hey, you... Did you just say "Players"?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.810
Why do you know about us?

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.140
Nii-san! Don't revert!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:43.440
You'll be noticed by the sweeper.

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:44.640
So what?!

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.690
This guy knows about us.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.400
We should finish him!

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.610
He's really gone and done it...

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.080
I don't really wanna chew on this, but...

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:02.370
How's Jin?!

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.040
He chewed the activation gum.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.590
Get up, Shu!

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:11.800
The sweeper's coming!

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:13.880
What about Aniki?

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:14.550
Just give up on him.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.640
Your brothers are pretty heartless.

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:25.480
I don't care.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.690
They're not my real brothers,

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.690
and anyway, you'll be killed in an instant.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:32.900
I think an instant kill's impossible...

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:36.610
...since I'm gonna fight back.

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:05.270
Hurry up and awaken!

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:09.690
Y-You're really strong.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:12.230
I feel so refreshed.

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:15.440
I can't believe reverting feels so good.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.170
Melt! It'll only hurt for a second.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:33.670
I'm not good at putting up with pain!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.730
100 percent!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.980
Things are getting interesting.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.740
Mr. Chairman!

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.140
The numbers are still going up!

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:34.060
He's never evolved this far before.

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:38.070
Jin is certainly drawing closer to becoming Zet.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:40.820
Die!

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.800
I feel sick.

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:01.720
I'm never gonna chew on this stuff again.

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:10.220
Strange.

00:20:10.220 --> 00:20:11.310
It's too white.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.770
The shape is strange, too.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:17.070
Why won't he become red with numbers like this?

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:18.730
Mr. Chairman!

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:20.150
Even though Zet's defeated the player,

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:22.150
he hasn't changed back into Jin!

00:20:22.150 --> 00:20:24.410
The Player's not dead yet.

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:26.240
That's the only possibility.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:35.330
This is bad...

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.790
He's started breaking down!

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:40.590
We have no choice but to kill the Player. Go!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:48.640
Keep on searching.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:51.310
You won't find me.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:55.560
The Sweeper!

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:59.190
Obey the rules.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.940
Did you forget the law of EVOL?

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:06.240
Why do we have to live our lives like the humans?

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:08.830
I'm going to live freely!

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:12.950
It's problematic that everyone who reverts becomes so brazen.

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.710
You're mistaken.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:21.590
Freedom lies within the rules.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.070
Hey!

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:25.290
That light!

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:29.640
Could it be what the Chairman said...?

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:01.880
This is... the sweeper?

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:16.340
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:23.180
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:23.180 --> 00:22:29.460
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.460 --> 00:22:36.130
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:45.690
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:51.510
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:58.350
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:09.770
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:17.410
Darling, the miracle of the two of us meeting in this world.

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:28.860
With only a trace of that, me loving you.

00:23:35.660 --> 00:23:36.450
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:37.600
Don't peek!
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:39.210
There's no cape!

00:23:39.210 --> 00:23:41.100
I'd like to test you.

00:23:41.630 --> 00:23:42.630
Onii-chan! Save m-

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:44.130
Alphas
Onii-chan! Save m-

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:45.510
Alphas
